# S07-T06: Company Section Navigation Sync

## Objective

Wire new org pages into company index; renumber work-control page if needed.

## App-agent preflight (MANDATORY before code)

- [ ] MCP preflight — WARN if `:3000` down
- [ ] `list-pages` category `company` — full inventory before renumber
- [ ] `get-page` — every existing company page (index, handbook, work-control)
- [ ] `get-file` — filesystem paths under `docs/content/2.company/` to match MCP inventory

## Implementation

- [ ] Update `docs/content/2.company/0.index.md` — list:
  - Handbook
  - Totem governance (T03)
  - Documentation layers (T04)
  - Work Control (renumber `3.work-control.md` → `4.work-control.md` if sort requires)
- [ ] Fix internal links if file renumbered
- [ ] Verify sort order matches numeric folder prefixes

## Done when (app-agent tools)

- [ ] `list-pages` category `company` — all pages listed including new ones
- [ ] `get-page` — each linked page resolves (no 404 via MCP)
- [ ] Nav on `:3000` human-check optional if MCP `get-page` passes
